sentences.text:
It is, accordingly directed that execution of remaining sentence of imprisonment of the appellant-Dinesh shall remain suspended during pendency of this appeal and he shall be enlarged on bail subject to furnishing personal bond in the sum of Rs.50,000/-
(Rupees Fifty Thousand) with one solvent surety in the like amount to the satisfaction of Trial Court for compliance with following 3 CRA-4202-2018 conditions:-
(1). The appellant shall deposit the amount of fine (if not deposited) forthwith;

